WEBVTT

00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:30.559
In fact, she negotiates
all kinds of things all the time.

00:10:30.583 --> 00:10:33.684
She even negotiated a discount
on a couch that she loved.

00:10:33.708 --> 00:10:36.184
GS: I think I saved like 20 percent.

00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:38.184
I'm a creative negotiator.

00:10:38.208 --> 00:10:39.643
(Laughs)

00:10:39.667 --> 00:10:41.458
Collaborative negotiator.

00:10:43.042 --> 00:10:45.643
AG: Collaborative is
not exactly how I'd describe

00:10:45.667 --> 00:10:48.851
another student I'd had
just a few years before Grace.

00:10:48.875 --> 00:10:52.309
He was the opposite
of a pushover, a steamroller.

00:10:52.333 --> 00:10:55.351
He wasn't interested
in solving a puzzle together.

00:10:55.375 --> 00:10:57.809
Jason Botterill: I was
a very aggressive negotiator.

00:10:57.833 --> 00:10:59.184
I wanted to win.

00:10:59.208 --> 00:11:02.101
AG: Steamrolling was
in Jason Botterill's blood.